  intro: { uz: "Yakshanba. Test kuni. Bugun yangi narsa yo'q — haftaning to'rt ustunli jadvali va sanalmaydigan otlar sinovdan o'tadi.", en: 'Sunday. Test day. Nothing new — the week\'s four-column table and the uncountable nouns are examined.' },
